        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute value counts for a single field (categorical facet). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Scans the secondary index for <computeroutput>table.column</computeroutput> and counts the occurrences of each distinct value, limited to documents in <computeroutput>candidate_pks</computeroutput> (if non-empty). If <computeroutput>candidate_pks</computeroutput> is empty all documents are counted.</para>
